<div class="aq-page"><section class="aq-section"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l">
  <h2 class="aq-h1">Configurations and options</h2>
  <ul class="aq-options" role="list">
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Single or double pass RO</h3><p class="aq-small">Double pass where feed is high in dissolved solids or where the same skid feeds a still.</p></li>
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Hot water sanitizable</h3><p class="aq-small">Heat-tolerant membranes and a sanitization heat exchanger for 80 °C cycles.</p></li>
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Integrated pretreatment</h3><p class="aq-small">Softener, carbon or bisulfite dosing mounted on the same skid where space is short.</p></li>
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Variable speed pumps</h3><p class="aq-small">Constant permeate flow as feed temperature and membrane fouling change.</p></li>
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Duplex trains</h3><p class="aq-small">Two trains at 50 or 100 % each, so one runs while the other is serviced.</p></li>
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Ultrafiltration or UV</h3><p class="aq-small">Downstream ultrafiltration or 254 nm UV where your microbial target needs more margin.</p></li>
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Recovery enhancement</h3><p class="aq-small">Concentrate recycle or a reject RO to reduce water sent to drain.</p></li>
    <li class="aq-options__item"><span class="aq-options__tag" aria-hidden="true"><span class="aq-options__mark"></span></span><h3 class="aq-h3">Instrumentation</h3><p class="aq-small">Online conductivity at each stage, optional online TOC at the skid outlet.</p></li>
  </ul>
</div></section></div>
